 "transcript": [
  "[action] The eldest son returns from a trip with Pear Blossom.",
  "[action] (to the eldest son) Wang Lung stands and stares at his son.",
  "the eldest son (to Wang Lung): \"It is a good thing I am an officer and have a wife, for it is the only way to keep you from selling the last bit of land and starving us, for I would not live on such poor food as you eat and the woman I have taken for my wife would not abide it,\"",
  "[action] The eldest son stands with his back to his father.",
  "[silence] (to the eldest son) Wang Lung says nothing.",
  "[action] (to the eldest son) Wang Lung looks at his son with amazement.",
  "[action] The eldest son eats and looks at his father with disdain.",
  "[says] The eldest son makes a boastful speech.",
  "[says] The eldest son boasts about his life.",
  "the eldest son: \"Well, and it is a great thing to be a man and to eat meat and drink wine and to have a wife, and to be a man among men and not a worm like you are, who sit in the dust and feed on vegetables and drink sour water,\"",
  "Wang Lung (to the eldest son): \"You would not have been fed if I had not taken you from my bosom and had not fed you from my body,\"",
  "[says] (to Wang Lung) The eldest son responds with scorn and pride.",
  "[says] (to Wang Lung) The eldest son responds with scorn and pride.",
  "[says] (to Wang Lung) The eldest son responds with scorn and pride.",
  "[action] (to the eldest son) Wang Lung weeps and strokes his son's head.",
  "[action] (to the eldest son) Wang Lung weeps and strokes his son's head.",
  "[action] Wang Lung weeps for his son.",
  "Wang Lung: \"Here is my own flesh and blood, my son!\"",
  "Wang Lung (to the eldest son): \"Now you are a man and you have a woman, and I am old and I have none. I have none, my son!\"",
  "Wang Lung: \"Do not forget your old father, my son!\""
 ],
